<title>USA: Carrington expands sales distribution pact.</title>
<headline>Carrington expands sales distribution pact.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING, Tex. 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carrington Laboratories Inc said on Monday it granted exclusive sales distribution rights for its wound and skin care products in certain Central and South American countries to Suco International Corp.</p>
<p>Suco will receive exclusive distribution rights for five years with an option for five more years in the following countries: Colombia, Venezuela, Ecuador, Bolivia, Peru, Paraguay, Uruguay and Haiti.</p>
<p>The company disclosed no further details of the agreement.</p>
</text>
